%%{init: {'sequence': {'width': 220}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Server
    participant G as Google

    B->>S: 1. Click "Login with Google"
    S-->>B: 2. Redirect to Google (with state, nonce)
    B->>G: 3. User logs in & consents
    G-->>B: 4. Return authorization code
    B->>S: 5. POST authorization code
    S->>G: 6. Exchange code for tokens
    G-->>S: 7. Return id_token (JWT)
    S->>S: Verify JWT, extract user info<br/>Create session
    S-->>B: 8. Set session cookie
